{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "The farmer sat gloomily on the bench and would not eat. And you cannot wonder, for he saw us putting potfuls of his good beef and bascule loads of bread into our big mouths.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["The", " farmer", " sat", " glo", "om", "ily", " on", " the", " bench", " and", " would", " not", " eat", ".", " And", " you", " cannot", " wonder", ",", " for", " he", " saw", " us", " putting", " pot", "ful", "s", " of", " his", " good", " beef", " and", " bas", "c", "ule", " loads", " of", " bread", " into", " our", " big", " mouths", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
